WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:02.833
Roxy gave the squire a suspicious look.

2
00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:06.392
"How did you know I have super powers?"

3
00:00:06.393 --> 00:00:10.286
"My servants told me," the squire said.

4
00:00:10.287 --> 00:00:15.095
"They, um, saw you fight those robbers last night."

5
00:00:15.096 --> 00:00:20.466
"That's odd," Roxy said. "I didn't see your servants until after the fight."

6
00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:29.026
"Tell me," the squire asked quickly, "does everyone in your world have powers?"

7
00:00:29.027 --> 00:00:31.822
"Nope, just me," Roxy said.

8
00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:36.486
The squire stroked his chin. "Very interesting.

9
00:00:36.487 --> 00:00:44.632
You must stay here for a long time—as my guest."

10
00:00:44.633 --> 00:00:50.004
In the morning Wukong woke up and stretched.

11
00:00:50.005 --> 00:00:54.164
Looking down from his ledge, he saw workers cleaning up the mess he'd made.

12
00:00:54.165 --> 00:00:55.782
He could hear them talking.

13
00:00:55.783 --> 00:00:57.330
"What a mess!"

14
00:00:57.331 --> 00:01:00.384
"That monkey smashed a lot of cars!"

15
00:01:00.385 --> 00:01:05.513
"So, those things are called cars," Wukong thought.

16
00:01:05.514 --> 00:01:08.839
Along the street he saw other cars moving peacefully.

17
00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:12.112
He also noticed that nobody was standing in the middle of the street.

18
00:01:12.113 --> 00:01:16.334
Wukong chuckled. "I guess the cars weren't trying to attack me.

19
00:01:16.335 --> 00:01:18.551
I was just standing in their way."

20
00:01:18.552 --> 00:01:21.028
Wukong decided to start looking for Bajie.

21
00:01:21.029 --> 00:01:26.432
He flew down to the street and called to a man, "Hello! What is this place?"

22
00:01:26.433 --> 00:01:31.576
"Don't hurt me!" The man ran off.

23
00:01:31.577 --> 00:01:35.658
Wukong tried to talk to other people, but everyone was scared of him.

24
00:01:35.659 --> 00:01:40.308
Finally he approached several people in blue uniforms who were helping with the cleanup.

25
00:01:40.309 --> 00:01:44.170
"Detective, there's the monkey!" one of them cried.

26
00:01:44.171 --> 00:01:48.363
A man in a long coat walked over and puffed out his chest.

27
00:01:48.364 --> 00:01:52.751
"I'm Detective Smith, and you had better not cause any more trouble!"

28
00:01:52.752 --> 00:01:58.218
Wukong laughed. "Relax! Yesterday was just a big misunderstanding.

29
00:01:58.219 --> 00:02:00.923
I'm looking for a friend who's big and lazy and—"

30
00:02:00.924 --> 00:02:05.089
"Where's Rocket Girl?" Detective Smith asked.

31
00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:07.757
"Oh, don't worry," Wukong said.

32
00:02:07.758 --> 00:02:12.776
"That evil goddess is in another world so she can't harm your kingdom anymore."

33
00:02:12.777 --> 00:02:19.784
Detective Smith's mouth hung open. "Rocket Girl isn't evil—she's a hero.

34
00:02:19.785 --> 00:02:24.798
Without her, we'll have all sorts of bad guys running around the city."

35
00:02:24.799 --> 00:02:28.733
"Oops," Wukong thought. "I guess I made a mistake."

36
00:02:28.734 --> 00:02:34.916
Detective Smith looked concerned. "How did Rocket Girl wind up in another world?"

37
00:02:34.917 --> 00:02:38.089
"I didn't see it happen," Wukong said with a shrug.

38
00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:43.264
"But I can be your kingdom's new hero. Take me to your king!"

39
00:02:43.265 --> 00:02:45.781
Detective Smith scratched his head.

40
00:02:45.782 --> 00:02:50.495
"We don't have a king, but I suppose you could talk to Mayor Bloom."

41
00:02:50.496 --> 00:03:00.196
He gave Wukong directions to City Hall, and Wukong hurried off.

42
00:03:00.197 --> 00:03:04.603
"Hello, Mayor Bloom," Wukong said at City Hall.

43
00:03:04.604 --> 00:03:08.588
"I'm Sun Wukong, King of the Fruit and Flower Mountain."

44
00:03:08.589 --> 00:03:13.356
"I've never heard of that place," Mayor Bloom said.

45
00:03:13.357 --> 00:03:15.865
Wukong looked at a picture on the mayor's desk.

46
00:03:15.866 --> 00:03:20.981
"I'm great at destroying demons, so if there's a demon problem, I can handle it."

47
00:03:20.982 --> 00:03:28.653
Mayor Bloom raised an eyebrow. "We don't have a demon problem in Metro City."

48
00:03:28.654 --> 00:03:36.355
Just then his phone rang. "Hello? Oh, dear!" He hung up.

49
00:03:36.356 --> 00:03:40.678
"True Savings Bank is being robbed—I must call Rocket Girl."

50
00:03:40.679 --> 00:03:43.296
The mayor pressed a button on the phone and waited.

51
00:03:43.297 --> 00:03:46.365
When nobody answered, he looked at Wukong.

52
00:03:46.366 --> 00:03:49.187
Wukong grinned. "Don't worry, Mayor.

53
00:03:49.188 --> 00:03:54.882
I'm on my way! Just tell me where True Savings Bank is."

